{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"odin","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Odin","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Odin (.odin).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"odin","name":"Odin","extensions":[".odin"],"grammar":"grammars/odin.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Odin","path":"snippets/odin.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/odin.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@\\\\(?[A-Za-z_][\\\\w=\\\"]*\\\\)?\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:fallthrough|or_continue|bit_field|transmute|auto_cast|or_return|continue|distinct|or_break|package|foreign|bit_set|dynamic|context|or_else|import|not_in|switch|return|struct|break|defer|union|using|where|when|else|case|proc|enum|cast|for|map|if|in|do)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:cstring|string|rawptr|typeid|uint|bool|rune|byte|int|i16|i32|i64|u16|u32|u64|f16|f32|f64|any|i8|u8)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:fmt\\\\.println|fmt\\\\.printf|delete|append|assert|panic|make|free|len|cap|new)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/odin.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"package main\",\n      \"\",\n      \"import \\\"core:fmt\\\"\",\n      \"\",\n      \"main :: proc() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A main package\"\n  },\n  \"Procedure\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} :: proc(${2:x}: ${3:int}) -> ${4:int} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A procedure\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:Name} :: struct {\",\n      \"\\t${2:field}: ${3:int},\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"For range\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:i} in 0..<${2:10} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for in\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Odin\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Odin.\n\n## Files\n\n`.odin`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | A main package |\n| `proc` | A procedure |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `for` | for in |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}